# WebSurfaceHQ .gitignore
# Generated output must never be committed — in particular, build output must
# never trip the CI secrets job. (11 Nov 2026: gitleaks flagged 3 findings in
# apps/web/.next/ build output — per-build ephemeral encryption/signing keys
# (previewModeEncryptionKey, previewModeSigningKey, encryptionKey), rotated
# every build. Not long-lived credentials and worthless without a running app
# (no preview mode, no Server Actions exist), but they ARE real keys, not
# "hashes" — never commit them. The fix is this file, NOT a gitleaks
# allowlist entry.)

# --- Env files: ignore everything except .env.example -----------------------
.env*
!.env.example

# --- Node / frontend --------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/

# --- Go ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/packages/scanner-agent/scanner-agent
*.test

# --- OS / IDE ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
coverage/
